    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107210/extras/8575c5be9f0b0356fbc6bfd81309efc8.poster.avif?t=1740367784\" width=616 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107210/extras/8575c5be9f0b0356fbc6bfd81309efc8.webm?t=1740367784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107210/extras/8575c5be9f0b0356fbc6bfd81309efc8.mp4?t=1740367784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107210/extras/c43005afd09017ce3066c80df4639c0d.poster.avif?t=1740367784\" width=616 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107210/extras/c43005afd09017ce3066c80df4639c0d.webm?t=1740367784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107210/extras/c43005afd09017ce3066c80df4639c0d.mp4?t=1740367784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107210/extras/301606ad517cef9abe17c594f5b564b3.webp?t=1740367784\" width=600 height=32 /></span><br><strong>&quot;Well, I'm glad that worked&quot;</strong> <br>Awaken from cryogenic sleep on a space station running off of auxiliary power.<br>Is there anyone else here? Someone had to have woken you up... <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107210/extras/301606ad517cef9abe17c594f5b564b3.webp?t=1740367784\" width=600 height=32 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Style / Modern Twists</h2> SolFall is built with Unreal Engine 5 to deliver a smooth physics-based survival horror puzzle platformer under the guise of a unique pixel art style. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Under the hood, Solfall is able to utilize Unreal's <u>Lumen technology</u> to provide unique lighting conditions within this pixelized world. <br><br>Indirect lighting bounces from light sources to help you see what's lurking in the dark! <br><br></li><li>Enjoy a powerful physics engine powering movable obstructing and puzzle-based objects within the station. <br><br></li><li>Kinematics fuel the horrors that lay within deep space. <br><br></li><li>Full 360 degree camera and character motion allows for smooth perspective shifts navigating this top-down tale. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107210/extras/301606ad517cef9abe17c594f5b564b3.webp?t=1740367784\" width=600 height=32 /></span>",
